,{"children":"Supply trains moved first. XVII Corps was to lead, followed by XVI Corps and XV Corps, with only one baggage wagon per regiment and battery."}]]}]]}],["$","div","McPherson began leaving the U.S. left",{"className":"moment","children":[["$","$L17",null,{"seconds":838,"label":"13:58"}],"$L18"]}],"$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}]]}]
